==Norwegian Bokmål==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|nn|skulla}} {{qualifier|Nynorsk, infinitive}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|nb}} {{term|skulu|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|nb}} {{m|gem-pro|*skulaną}}.

===Verb===
{{head|nb|verb|present tense|skal|simple past|skulle|past participle|skullet}}

'''''Bokmål:''''' {{nb-verb|skal|skulle|skullet}}

'''''Nynorsk:''''' {{nn-verb|skal|skulle|skulla}}

# [[will]], [[shall]], [[should]] (''modal verbs'')

#: ''alt fungerer som det '''skal''' - everything works as it '''should'''''

#: ''Eg '''skal''' gjere det.'' {{qualifier|nynorsk}}
#: I '''will''' do it.
# [[shall]]
#: ''Det '''skulle''' få motoren til å verke.'' {{qualifier|nynorsk}}
#: That '''should''' make the engine work.

